>> Combination := Orodha mpya.

Combination ikija: ['ongeza-mwishoni:'] fanya: { :el
	binafsi 
	tafuta: el, Tupu? kweli: { binafsi ongeza-mwishoni: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination mpya.
colours
	ongeza-mwishoni: ['red'],
	ongeza-mwishoni: ['green'],
	ongeza-mwishoni: ['blue'],
	ongeza-mwishoni: ['red'].

Towe andika: colours, mstari-mpya.
